eren't expecting to see  in the distance they see the wreck of an  enormous ship  and the name on the side of this ship  the caravel and this was the origin  of the signal that they'd been following  since the beginning  before leaving earth's orbit the caravel  had been destroyed  so how had it ended up on a knock  it turns out that the people who were  left behind were not only able to repair  the damage  but were able to rebuild and upgrade the  engines to a more advanced state than  the flores  and with that the caraval actually  managed to arrive at a knock  ahead of them the newly constructed ship  was captained by a man named monroy who  was a survivor  of the original explosion and holds a  grudge against the outriders for leaving  them behind  on a dying earth upon arriving on a  knock  monroy's people were the ones who made  first contact with the pax  but over time monroy learned of their  powers and enhanced abilities  relating to the anomaly and he started  getting paranoid he ordered the murder  of all pax leadership  and enslaved the rest to work in labor  camps some managed to escape  but were hunted down eventually it got  too much  and the pecs began using the anomaly to  turn themselves feral  in order to defend themselves and put a  stop to monroy's forces  the anomaly appears to be a part of this  world and it's the packs that have been  channeling it  and keeping it under control up to this  point when left with no other choice  the pacs turn themselves into the  current savage forms and wiped out the  caraval colonists  leaving the anomaly unchecked and out of  control to violently sweep across the  planet  so the storm that destroyed the  outriders and caused the rift between  the members of the eca  was initially caused by monroy and his  treatment of the pax  after locating and putting an end to the  ageing monroy the group was able to send  the uplink signal to the flores  drop pods full of supplies began raining  down on the planet while 